  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\n\u015Eans\u0131n
    bug\xFCne kadar hep yaver gitmi\u015F {{isim}}. U\u011Fra\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    her konuda ba\u015Far\u0131ya ula\u015Fm\u0131\u015F, olumlu geli\u015Fmeler
    ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F ve g\xFCzel haberler alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Se\xE7mi\u015F
    oldu\u011Fun kart, ge\xE7mi\u015Fte yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F olan kutlamalardan
    bahsediyor. \u0130nsanlar\u0131 bir araya getiren, ayn\u0131 ortamda toplayan
    hay\u0131rl\u0131 olaylar vuku bulmu\u015F. Belki ya\u015F g\xFCn\xFC, belki
    do\u011Fum g\xFCnleri, belki de bir do\u011Fum... Hayat\u0131na apayr\u0131 lezzetler
    katm\u0131\u015F. Diledi\u011Fin dilekler ger\xE7ekle\u015Fmi\u015F. Yoluna emek
    verdi\u011Fin beklentilerinin kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Bug\xFCnlere keyifle, dolu dolu ya\u015Fayarak gelmi\u015Fsin."
